# Forklift UX Patterns (MTV Console Plugin)

Load this file when designing or reviewing UI in this repository. Pair with
`.cursor/rules/agents/ux-reviewer.mdc`.

The plugin runs **inside OpenShift Console** (PatternFly 6). Reuse existing
surfaces before inventing new layout patterns.

---

## Domain areas

| Area | List entry | Details / tabs | Notes |
|------|------------|----------------|-------|
| Providers | `src/providers/list/ProvidersListPage.tsx` | `src/providers/details/*` (type-specific pages) | Inventory tabs (VMs, networks, hosts, credentials) |
| Plans | `src/plans/list/PlansListPage.tsx` | `src/plans/details/` | Migration execution, VM list, concerns panel |
| Network maps | `src/networkMaps/list/NetworkMapsListPage.tsx` | `src/networkMaps/details/` | Mapping tables |
| Storage maps | `src/storageMaps/list/StorageMapsListPage.tsx` | `src/storageMaps/details/` | Offload plugins, mapping tables |
| Overview | `src/overview/` | Dashboard / history | `MigrationsListPage` under history |

