## Screen types and canonical components

### List pages

- **Shell:** `StandardPage` or `StandardPageWithSelection` (`src/components/page/`)
- **Toolbar:** `PageToolbar`, filters via `FilterGroup` patterns in `StandardPageInner`
- **Table:** `PageTable` + `TableView` row/header components
- **Examples:** `PlansListPage.tsx`, `ProvidersListPage.tsx`, `StorageMapsListPage.tsx`
- **Selection flows:** `PlanSpecVirtualMachinesList.tsx`, plan VM picker patterns

### Details pages

- **Title:** `PageHeader` (`src/components/page/components/PageHeader.tsx`) or feature headers (`PlanPageHeader`, `ProviderPageHeader`)
- **Alerts above content:** `forklift-page-headings-alerts`, `forklift-page-header-alerts` SCSS blocks
- **Body sections:** `PageSection` with `hasBodyWrapper={false}` and BEM classes:
  - `forklift-page-section` — general sections
  - `forklift-page-section--details` — key-value / description blocks
  - `forklift-page-section--info` — provider info sections
- **Example:** `StorageMapDetailsTab.tsx`, `DetailsSection.tsx` (providers)

### Wizards

- **Create plan:** `src/plans/create/CreatePlanWizard.tsx`, `WizardStepContainer`, context via `CreatePlanWizardContextProvider`
- **Footer:** `CreatePlanWizardFooter.tsx` — primary/secondary wizard actions
- New multi-step flows should follow the same step container + context pattern

### Modals and overlays

- **Default:** `ModalForm` (`src/components/ModalForm/ModalForm.tsx`) — confirm/cancel, errors, loading on submit
- **Simple text edit:** `TextInputEditModal`
- **Large content / tables in modal:** `InspectVirtualMachinesModal.tsx` — `ModalForm` + `Alert` + embedded table
- **Do not** use raw `Modal` + manual footer unless `ModalForm` cannot fit (rare)

### Inline edits on details

- Small field edits: modal pattern (`EditPlanMigrationType`, `StorageMapEdit`, `MapProvidersEdit`)
- Patch constants: `@components/ModalForm/utils/constants` (`ADD`, `REPLACE`)

### Shared list/detail utilities

- **Loading:** `LoadingSuspend` wrapping async CRD or inventory data
- **Empty:** PatternFly `EmptyState` when `isEmpty()` from `@utils/helpers`
- **Maps:** `MapProvidersDetails` / `MapProvidersEdit` for provider pairing UI

---

## Console integration

- **Resources:** `useK8sWatchResource`, `k8sCreate` / `k8sUpdate` / `k8sPatch` / `k8sDelete`
- **Namespace:** `useActiveNamespace` where list scope applies
- **Modals:** `OverlayComponent` type from console SDK for launchable overlays
- **Navigation:** Console owns global masthead/nav; plugin pages use in-plugin breadcrumbs/tabs only

---

## Styling conventions

- Project SCSS with BEM (`forklift-*` blocks); see `.cursor/rules/styles.mdc`
- PatternFly theme tokens: `--pf-t--global--*` (not hardcoded hex)
- Prefer PF layout components (`Stack`, `Flex`, `Grid`) over custom flex SCSS

---

## i18n

- All user-visible strings: `useForkliftTranslation` / `t('...')`
- Links inside sentences: `ForkliftTrans` — see `.cursor/rules/i18n.mdc`

---

## When adding a new surface

1. Find the closest row in the tables above and **copy its structure**.
2. Add a line to this file in the same PR if you introduce a new reusable screen type.
